{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/62f057e16601dfef3816179e72baa8b2.avif?t=1760922472\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game at the bottom of your screen that won't interrupt your daily life. Research tech, grow crops, automate workflows, explore the map, and craft with machinery to fend off monsters. One person, one dog - conquer the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planting crops:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a variety of crops. Obtain seeds and plant them in your newly tilled farmland. This is a vital source of food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.poster.avif?t=1760922472\" width=630 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.webm?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/8f0052c51b708055e651a4b24e7b414a.mp4?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building an electrical system:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shelter and automation drones/robots require power. Build generators and charging stations to keep them running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.poster.avif?t=1760922472\" width=630 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.webm?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/ca4fa46d7bd02787b4483d0c3c08bd95.mp4?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Robots Work For You:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy cute drones or robots to help collect resources, farm, and explore the map. More machines to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.poster.avif?t=1760922472\" width=630 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.webm?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/324ae4c68e0f96bbc252078efe9ea8b7.mp4?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction and production:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from the wild, craft essential items, and build up your shelter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.poster.avif?t=1760922472\" width=630 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.webm?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/43780186f28832cce836f9549366ad7a.mp4?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend against attacks:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the shelter grows, it attracts monster attacks. Unlock more powerful attacks now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/979470642491c4e13f101f2f13a713e7.poster.avif?t=1760922472\" width=630 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/979470642491c4e13f101f2f13a713e7.webm?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/979470642491c4e13f101f2f13a713e7.mp4?t=1760922472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct radar to reveal the map. Dispatch scout drones to gather more resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemy types and unique weapons are coming in the future, along with new buildings and gameplay. Stay tuned to discover what's next!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617390?t=1760922472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617390?t=1760922472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/529fdbe11d40d9b39dff90a40d6660fbb8e15de3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760922472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/529fdbe11d40d9b39dff90a40d6660fbb8e15de3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760922472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam A